ed_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I tried the code, and it seems to work, so that's good! With the tweaks below it should be good to merge.\r\n\r\nJudging by the tailscale source, we should be getting three requests in quick succession on startup:\r\n\r\n* ReadOnly=true, OmitPeers=true, Stream=false (aka \"give me the DERP map, ignore my endpoint update, it is empty/meaningless\")\r\n* ReadOnly=false, OmitPeers=true, Stream=false (aka \"here's my endpoint update, don't stream to me\")\r\n* ReadOnly=false, OmitPeers=false, Stream=true (aka the HTTP Long Poll connection)\r\n\r\nIt seems that the client sometimes remembers the DERP map from a previous invocation, which means it skips the first request.","commit_id":"064e448d2233ac81ca3e5787b96e355910e9902a","state":"commented","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/31#pullrequestreview-668538187","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/31","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/31#pullrequestreview-668538187"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/31"}},"submitted_at":"2021-05-26T02:14:55Z","updated_at":"2021-05-26T02:14:55Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","event":"reviewed"},{"sha":"4be39f9b83dbc4fe0757b837c3be02f977646370","node_id":"MDY6Q29tbWl0MjczODcxODU5OjRiZTM5ZjliODNkYmM0ZmUwNzU3YjgzN2MzYmUwMmY5Nzc2NDYzNzA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/4be39f9b83dbc4fe0757b837c3be02f977646370","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/4be39f9b83dbc4fe0757b837c3be02f977646370","author":{"name":"Juan Font Alonso","email":"juanfontalonso@gmail.com","date":"2021-05-26T19:39:57Z"},"committer":{"name":"Juan Font Alonso","email":"juanfontalonso@gmail.com","date":"2021-05-26T19:39:57Z"},"tree":{"sha":"95103d8ad8e97184f659e8eab6ead1193bab1fc8","url":"https://api.